    <string name="step_two_body" formatted="false">Cheza video, kisha uguse Tafuta video. Chagua faili iliyotambuliwa, au ubandike kiungo cha moja kwa moja cha video cha HTTPS.</string>
    <string name="step_three_title" formatted="false">Fanya iwe yako</string>
    <string name="step_three_body" formatted="false">Chagua jina la faili, thibitisha ruhusa yako ili kuhifadhi video, na uguse Pakua. Android inaendelea kupakua chinichini.</string>
    <string name="step_four_title" formatted="false">Furahia mkusanyiko wako</string>
    <string name="step_four_body" formatted="false">Fungua Vipakuliwa ili kuangalia maendeleo. Cheza au ushiriki video zilizokamilishwa. Jaribu tena vipakuliwa vilivyoshindwa kwa kiungo kipya inapohitajika.</string>
